WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.208
Every single night, a terribly lonely young boy wished he could stop time.

2
00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:10.704
Then one fateful afternoon, his desperate wish unexpectedly came true for him.

3
00:00:10.704 --> 00:00:15.600
He could suddenly freeze everything around him including the heavy rain and people.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.712
For a long time, he felt completely invincible like a powerful god.

5
00:00:20.712 --> 00:00:26.328
He cleverly used his terrifying new power to easily avoid every painful problem.

6
00:00:26.328 --> 00:00:31.752
However, he slowly began noticing a horrifying price hidden within his gift.

7
00:00:31.752 --> 00:00:37.704
Each time he froze moments, someone he deeply loved permanently forgot his existence.

8
00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:43.224
Desperate to fix everything, he stopped time one final time to whisper quietly.

9
00:00:43.224 --> 00:00:47.616
He begged the universe for a fragile world where he could stay present.

10
00:00:47.616 --> 00:00:52.848
He finally let time flow forward and chose growing older over living forever.
